The JPEG XL decoder (crates/otf-pixels-codec-jxl/src/decode) follows the
decoding procedures of jxl-oxide <https://github.com/tirr-c/jxl-oxide>, and
ports some of its tables and routines (entropy decoding, ICC profile
reconstruction, Modular transforms, VarDCT dequantization and transforms,
restoration filters). jxl-oxide is Copyright (c) the jxl-oxide authors,
